<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-686] Duplicated ZEPPELIN_INTP_JAVA_OPTS in interpreter processes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-686</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Because bin/common.sh is read twice by interpreter processes, ZEPPELIN_INTP_JAVA_OPTS is duplicated. This makes some of the configurations (such as remote debug settings) for interpreter failed&lt;/p&gt;</description>
